# promise: #76 #600
# A pinned tab's and a favorite's right-click menu list Edit Pinned URL… and Replace Pinned URL with Current
# at the top level, right after Rename…, not in Arc's Edit Pinned Page ▸ submenu. Anoninz asked for them
# beside Rename… on PR #55 to save a click (#76, 1 Nov 2026). The Arc row-for-row menus for #600 put the
# submenu back, and Anoninz asked on #600 (22 Nov) for the flat rows again: Victor's call, Cra keeps them flat.
# Replace is dimmed while the tab is on its pinned page and works from the top level.
budget rss=700 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": false}

# A pinned tab, moved off its pinned page.
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=pin
expect-log loaded 127\.0\.0\.1 \(HTTP 200\)
cra://action/pinTab
wait 1
cra://debug?tabMenu=1&label=pin-home
expect-log tab menu pin-home: Copy Link\|Share ▸\|──\|Change Icon…\|Rename…\|Edit Pinned URL…\|Replace Pinned URL with Current \(off\)\|Mute \(off\)\|
cra://navigate?url=${PAGE}?n=moved
wait 1
cra://debug?tabMenu=1&label=pin-away
expect-log tab menu pin-away: Copy Link\|Share ▸\|──\|Change Icon…\|Rename…\|Edit Pinned URL…\|Replace Pinned URL with Current\|Mute \(off\)\|Cast…\|Customize Page…\|──\|Add Split View\|Duplicate\|Move to ▸\|──\|Remove Pin$
cra://debug?tabMenu=1&label=pin-replace&run=Replace Pinned URL with Current
expect-log tab menu pin-replace ran Replace Pinned URL with Current: pinned: n=moved
cra://debug?tabMenu=1&label=pin-replaced
expect-log tab menu pin-replaced: .*\|Rename…\|Edit Pinned URL…\|Replace Pinned URL with Current \(off\)\|Mute

# A favorite, moved off its pinned page.
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=fav
wait 1
cra://action/favoriteTab
wait 1
cra://navigate?url=${PAGE}?n=favmoved
wait 1
cra://debug?favoriteMenu=1&label=fav-away
expect-log favorite menu fav-away: Copy Link\|Share ▸\|──\|Change Icon…\|Tile Color ▸\|Rename…\|Edit Pinned URL…\|Replace Pinned URL with Current\|Mute \(off\)\|Customize Page…\|──\|
cra://debug?favoriteMenu=1&label=fav-replace&run=Replace Pinned URL with Current
cra://debug?favoriteMenu=1&label=fav-replaced
expect-log favorite menu fav-replaced: .*\|Rename…\|Edit Pinned URL…\|Replace Pinned URL with Current \(off\)\|Mute

# Never the submenu, on either menu.
reject-log (tab|favorite) menu (pin|fav)-.*Edit Pinned Page
